every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `.github/llm-providers/anthropic.toml:1-20` — Preserve explicit overlay exercises the config-file path; credential name; top-level model prevents ambient-provider fallback. Consumer: rebar config loader/external suite.\n- `.github/llm-providers/bedrock.toml:1-38` — Preserve inference-profile IDs only, region requirement, ambient AWS credentials, top-level model, provider-arm credential isolation. Consumer: rebar config loader/external suite.\n- `.github/llm-providers/openai.toml:1-23` — Preserve best-effort tier, credential, verified supported models, top-level model requirement. Consumer: rebar config loader/external suite.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":".github/llm-providers/anthropic.toml","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":".github/llm-providers/bedrock.toml","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":".github/llm-providers/openai.toml","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract.